{"id":"34c6582a4c","t":"Im Going To Destroy This Country","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/2025-01-31-04-39-20-1738341560395-1-193x278.jpg","n":102,"l":102,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"im-going-to-destroy-this-country"},"u":1795038499630,"desc":"هذا ما حدث، أو هكذا ظننت… ‘أيها القديس، هل استيقظت؟’ ما هذا الدفء؟ وما هذا الشعور الناعم؟ هل هذا… جسد إنسان؟ وأنا… قديس؟ ‘يا إلهي، لماذا يبدو القديس الصغير سعيدًا جدًا؟’ ‘أيها القديس، هذه هي لعبة ملك الهياكل العظمية . أترغب في تحطيمه؟’ ‘الآلهة العظماء استعادوا كل شيء من ملك الهياكل العظمية الذي تجرأ على تحديهم.’ … لنُدمر هذا البلد. سأصبح القديس الذي يسخر من الآلهة ويدمرهم جميعًا","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اعادة احياء","اكشن","سحر","فانتازا","مغامرة"],"src":{"ml":"im-going-to-destroy-this-country"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"im-going-to-destroy-this-country|/manga/im-going-to-destroy-this-country/1/"},"2":{"ml":"im-going-to-destroy-this-country|/manga/im-going-to-destroy-this-country/2/"},"3":{"ml":"im-going-to-destroy-this-country|/manga/im-going-to-destroy-this-country/3/"},"4":{"ml":"im-going-to-destroy-this-country|/manga/im-going-to-destroy-this-country/4/"},"5":{"ml":"im-going-to-destroy-this-country|/manga/im-going-to-destroy-this-country/5/"},"6":{"ml":"im-going-to-destroy-this-country|/manga/im-going-to-destroy-this-country/6/"},"7":{"ml":"im-going-to-destroy-this-country|/manga/im-going-to-destroy-this-country/7/"},"8":{"ml":"im-going-to-destroy-this-country|/manga/im-going-to-destroy-this-country/8/"},"9":{"ml":"im-going-to-destroy-this-country|/manga/im-going-to-destroy-this-country/9/"},"10":{"ml":"im-going-to-destroy-this-country|/manga/im-going-to-destroy-this-country/10/"},"11":{"ml":"im-going-to-destroy-this-country|/manga/im-going-to-destroy-this-country/11/"},"12":{"ml":"im-going-to-destroy-this-country|/manga/im-going-to-destroy-this-country/12/"},"13":{"ml":"im-going-to-destroy-this-country|/manga/im-going-to-destroy-this-country/13/"},"14":{"ml":"im-going-to-destroy-this-country|/manga/im-going-